Average dose (oral steroid only) $average_dose :number {min=1,max=99,size=4}

Adherence score (%) $score :number
Adherence $adherence :expression {data_type=text,size=15}

Adherent? $sr_adherence :yes_no [Y=Yes,N=No]
Scale $sr_scale :number {min=1,max=10,size=2}
